@Cristiano Ronaldo and Georgina Rodríguez (@georginagio)  are married! For weeks, the internet was awash with speculation—about the date, the location, the guest list. (The rumored celebrity attendees included everyone from Rio Ferdinand to Rihanna.) In the end, the couple’s wedding took place on a symbolic date: August 11, the 10th anniversary of the day they first met at a Gucci store in Madrid. Instead of a blowout celebration, the couple, who have over 750 million Instagram followers between them, got married in their living room, wearing @gucci by Demna. “It was exactly as I’d imagined it,” says Georgina.

For Vogue’s Summer digital cover, Gaby Wood spoke to Cris y Gio, as they are known to friends and family, about their intimate wedding day in Portugal. Tap the link in our bio for an exclusive look inside the ceremony.

Photographed by @juergentellerstudio, makeup by @fermartinezlab, hair by @torrentfernando, with special thanks to @angelsproject, Vogue, Summer Digital Cover 2026.

